# ==========================================
# SaidLang Tutorial 07: Natural English Syntax
# ==========================================

# 1. Defining variables in pure English (in both directions)
save name as Noman as string
save 17 in age as integer

# 2. String interpolation with @ variable reference & possessive properties
save Red Mustang in rohan's car as string
save Blue Sedan in sohan's car as string

say @name drives @rohan's car and friend drives @sohan's car

# 3. Dynamic repeats using variable count
save 3 in count as integer
repeat learning saidlang is fun @count times

# 4. Plain English comparison logic
save rohan's age as 15 as integer and mohan's age as 16 as integer

if rohan's age is bigger than mohan's age then say rohan is older else say mohan is older
